      "finding": "A shared validator rejects booleans, negatives and non-integers before reading. Cached bounds reject without rereceiving. Streaming counts actual chunks, stops at the first crossing before appending that chunk, marks the rejected stream consumed and assigns _body only after successful completion. Marking the rejected stream consumed is consistent with the explicit absence of a reread promise; normal json/stream implementations remain intact."
